[Resource from github at repo://missingbulb/EdFringeNow/sha/475ada91beacc69947573b08ff620fc1329e3bb2/contents/.claudinite/local/packs/edfringe-now/lookup-indices.mjs] // Dependency-free by design: a local pack's checks must load without the
